    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want to \"just exist\" like this. existing feels like a chore. honestly, when i think about it, the idea of just... stopping... it's the only thing that doesn't feel heavy. it's the only thought that actually feels like peace. it's like the only logical way to stop the breaking.",
